cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use ThinkLess in research or a publication, please cite it as below.
title: "ThinkLess: a decision plane for AI agents"
abstract: >-
  An open-source runtime that answers the routine decisions of AI agents with
  rules and small calibrated models, reserves generative models for the steps
  that need them, and traces every decision with its plane, confidence,
  latency and cost.
authors:
  - family-names: Kumar
    given-names: Praveen
repository-code: https://github.com/inboxpraveen/ThinkLess
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.3.0
date-released: 2026-09-25
keywords:
  - agents
  - large language models
  - decision models
  - calibration
  - observability
